        {"zh": "我从你脚边滚开", "en": "I roll out from under your feet."},
        {"zh": "别用脚试我", "en": "Don't test me with your foot."},
        {"zh": "滚远了，我还能滚回来", "en": "I rolled far and can roll back."},
        {"zh": "撞一下就变形了", "en": "One bump and I'm misshapen."}
