        {"zh": "我推着它滚", "en": "I push it along."},
        {"zh": "掉在地上的，正好", "en": "Just what I need on the ground."},
        {"zh": "这个能吃吗", "en": "Can this be eaten?"},
        {"zh": "我咬一口，又放下", "en": "I bite it once and put it down."},
        {"zh": "这一颗留着", "en": "I'll keep this one."},
        {"zh": "我身上没有地方放", "en": "I've nowhere to put it."},
        {"zh": "我们合力推", "en": "We push it together."},
        {"zh": "地上还剩几颗", "en": "A few are still on the ground."}
